OL,3,GNEWSAIntimate search of woman by
OL,4,Aofficer was 'unlawful'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Lincolnshire Police officer has been
OL,7,Fhanded a final written warning for
OL,8,Fgross misconduct after carrying out an
OL,9,Fintimate search of a vulnerable woman
OL,10,Fthat was found to be unlawful,
OL,11,Funnecessary and disproportionate.
OL,13,FPC Hannah Sleath conducted two searches
OL,14,Fof the patient, referred to as Ms A, at
OL,15,Fthe Peter Hodgkinson Centre at Lincoln
OL,16,FCounty Hospital on 16 July 2024.
OL,18,FThe searches "included touching in and
OL,19,Faround her vagina" after Ms A had
OL,20,Fconcealed drugs on her body.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
