OL,4,Aofficer was 'unlawful'
OL,5,
OL,6,FSleath was found to have breached
OL,7,Fprofessional standards and was handed
OL,8,Fthe warning which will last for five
OL,9,Fyears following a misconduct hearing at
OL,10,FGrantham Police Station.
